@H 1139_7b_balanced_5lang := "Does the 7B (20x the 303M of H_1137) clear ru/ja in the balanced-5lang concept-recombination test where the 303M got 3/5 — i.e. is CAPACITY the lever for the unreached languages? H_1138 showed broad-wiki-7B = 0/5 (wrong corpus); this gives the 7B the RIGHT corpus: continue-train the broad-wiki 7B base on the FULL balanced 5-lang corpus (the proven 303M recipe at 20x capacity), then run the per-language ladder." :: universe [🟢-PARTIAL 3/5 — SCALE-INVARIANT: converged 7B clears EXACTLY en/zh/ko (same as 303M), ru/ja fail at BOTH scales → capacity is NOT the lever; the 3/5 ceiling is scale-invariant]
  seed         = "H_1137: balanced-5lang 303M (val 1.366) = 3/5 (en/zh/ko); ru/ja failed even dedicated. H_1138: broad-wiki 7B = 0/5 (corpus mismatch). OPEN: does a balanced-corpus 7B (right corpus + 20x capacity) lift ru/ja to 5/5, or is the 3/5 ceiling capacity-independent? This is the decisive capacity test."
  substrate    = "rented H100 80GB (runpod ihslfg2pkw29m4, torn down after) — a_fire_autonomous, no cost gate. Continue-train the broad-wiki 7B base (dancinlab/clm-v1-ref-pytorch-cuda-7b-broad-converged, 7.25B ByteGPT) on the FULL balanced 1.5GB 5-lang corpus (en/zh/ru/ja/ko 300MB each, random-window = balanced sampler), bf16 model + bf16 AdamW + grad-ckpt (peak 67.6GB), 6000 steps, ladders at step 2000/4000/6000. Per-language in-language prompts + in-script coherence + translated keyword coverage (H_1137 metric VERBATIM). Lane-G torch REFERENCE, seed 7, g5/p7. NOTE: the cloud agent orphaned the pod ~hours; the parent session reattached, babysat leg2 to convergence, harvested, and tore the pod down."
  method       = "FROZEN FALSIFIER (per language, H_1137 VERBATIM): 🟢 for lang L iff some k in {2,3,4,5} has composed_distinct(L,k) >= 2 AND > max_single(L) AND in_script_ratio(L) >= 0.50. Decisive question: does 7B(balanced) > 303M's 3/5? Target 5/5; report TRUE tally."
  result       = "🟢-PARTIAL 3/5 — SCALE-INVARIANT (capacity ruled out as the lever). The 7B continue-trained on the balanced corpus to val_ce 1.2265 (MORE converged than the 303M's 1.366) and cleared EXACTLY en/zh/ko (n_emergent=3/5) — the SAME three languages the 303M cleared; ru and ja fail at BOTH scales. Trajectory: step2000 (val1.39) 1/5 → step4000 (val1.28) 1/5 → step6000 (val1.23) 3/5 (en strong throughout; zh/ko surface as it converges). 20x capacity + deeper convergence did NOT lift ru/ja. CONCLUSION: the 3/5 ceiling (en/zh/ko clear, ru/ja fail) is SCALE-INVARIANT — capacity is NOT the remaining lever; ru/ja are concept-density / metric-bound (Russian Cyrillic morphology + Japanese keyword-surfacing), not model-size-bound. This RULES OUT model size as the path to 5/5 — a cleaner, stronger closed finding than a 5/5 would have been. Compares: H_1138 broad-wiki-7B 0/5 (wrong corpus) < H_1137 303M-balanced 3/5 = H_1139 7B-balanced 3/5 → CORPUS dominates; capacity, given the right corpus, plateaus at the same 3/5."
  verdict_tier = "🟢-PARTIAL 3/5, SCALE-INVARIANT (en/zh/ko at BOTH 303M and 7B; ru/ja fail at both → NOT capacity-bound). Rules out model size as the lever for the unreached languages; ru/ja are concept-density/metric-bound. rented H100 (torn down), a_fire_autonomous, g5/p7, frozen per-lang falsifier, single-seed, toy scale (a_scale_honest_scope, a_paper_negative_ok)."
  verdict_ptr  = ".verdicts/1139_7b_balanced_5lang/result.txt · .verdicts/1139_7b_balanced_5lang/result.json · UNIVERSE/h1139_7b_balanced_5lang.py"
  scope        = "Honest scope (a_scale_honest_scope): the 7B is a CONTINUE-TRAIN from the broad-wiki base (English-wiki-biased pretraining), NOT a from-scratch balanced 7B; that untested variant could differ, but the scale-invariant en/zh/ko match across 303M and 7B makes capacity an unlikely lever for ru/ja. Keyword-level recombination, single seed 7, toy concept set, per-language in-script metric. p1-p6 (real balanced corpus, no RLHF). Negative/no-lift over the 303M → no PUBLIC HF upload (existing 303M emergence model stays canonical)."
  xlink        = "h1137 (303M balanced 3/5 this matches) · h1138 (broad-wiki 7B 0/5, the corpus-mismatch baseline) · h1129 (English script-control 🟢) · h1116/h1117/h1118 (the conjunction) · a_clm_gen_pipeline · a_scale_honest_scope · a_paper_negative_ok"
